<title>UK: UK money market forecasts 900 mln stg shortage.</title>
<headline>UK money market forecasts 900 mln stg shortage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average of forecasts by UK money market brokers of today's market shortage is 900 million stg, according to a Reuter market survey.</p>
<p>The official forecast for the shortage will be released by the Bank of England at between 0945 GMT and 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>Yesterday's final shortage was 1.3 bln stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
